# Built frontend — staged here by the build, then copied into
# teo-infra/nginx/html which is what actually serves it.
#
# UNRESOLVED: a standalone deploy needs these committed, because commit → push
# → pull is the only way files reach a server. But committing them here *and*
# in teo-infra duplicates ~58 MB per release across two repos. Decide before
# the first standalone deploy.
nginx/html/*/
